/E (Nowadays, many documents in education, government, and businesses are stored digitally instead of on paper. This has increased the need for fast and reliable document verification. However, online document sharing has also increased the risk of fake or modified documents, making trust and authenticity very important.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
